{"list_scraping_time": "1640924328", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ikan&updated-max=2012-03-10T19:30:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=847&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/01/banyak-kedai-tutup-sebab-cny.html", "list_item_title": "Chicken Sandwich Jer Sebab Banyak kedai Dah Tutup Untuk CNY ...", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "1/22/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n Add Comment \n", "list_item_category": "\nRoti\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Roti?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640924328", "page_title": "Chicken Sandwich Jer Sebab Banyak kedai Dah Tutup Untuk CNY ...", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "1/22/2012", "page_item_category": ["Roti"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Roti?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["\n", "Hari ini Boy ke OU untuk berjumpa kawan kawan dia dan saya bercadang untuk ke OU masa nak ambil dia dan bolehlah keluar makan makan sekali. Tapi Boy bagi BB message, katanya banyak kedai yang dah ditutup di OU. Ohhh gitu sekali ya...biasa kalau cuti panjang macam ni, memang saya akan bercuti atau balik kampung. Tapi sejak pindah ke KD, memang tak ada hati nak bercuti, dan malas juga nak menempuh jalan raya yang sesak untuk balik kampung. Ntah lah sejak dua menjak ni, ada ke istilah tu, hehehehe jadi penat lah kalau travel jauh jauh dan jalan sesak pulak tu ...", "\n", "Hari ini saya berselang seli, lepas masuk ke dapur, keluar tengok TV. Masuk dapur lagi dan keluar ke garden pulak, memang banyak aktiviti nak dibuat cuma badan jer rasa macam tak larat. Tapi dalam gitu, sempat juga menolong hubby mencuci air kolam ikan.\u00a0\u00a0", "\n", "Jadi apa yang nak ditulis ialah, kedai banyak tutup dan badan pun penat sebab menyibuk kat laman tadi, jadi saya rasa malas nak keluar cari makan. Jadi malam ni, cuma nak buat chicken sandwich menggunakan\u00a0", "roasted chicken yang\u00a0", "saya beli \u00a0di JJ One Utama malam tadi. Ringkas dan yang penting mengenyangkan. Kalau nak makan apa apa, boleh jer masak kerana stock makanan memang banyak pun.", "\n", "Buat sandwich menggunakan ayam panggang segera ni memang mudah, siak siak kan isi ayam, sapu dengan mayonis. Dulu saya pernah membuat entri yang serupa di ", ".", "\n", "Ambil 2 keping roti gardenia, letakkan apa apa sayuran di atas roti yang boleh juga jika mahu dilenser sedikit butter. Tak mahu pun tak apa, sebab mayonis tu dah very rich lah. \u00a0", "\n", "Akhir sekali, sudukan isi ayam di atas sayuran. Tutup dengan sekeping lagi roti dan siap untuk dinikmati....", "\n", "\n", "Oleh kerana ini jer sayuran yang ada di rumah kami, maka ini jer lah yang boleh diletak. Maklum lah, kedai banyak dah tutup, barang pun banyak kehabisan. \u00a0Apa apa pun, enjoy..."], "page_description_image_url": ["https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-OrS8nu8cimM/TxwJGvzndLI/AAAAAAAAEXA/WpmOTMeLBA4/s640/IMG_0569.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-_HYEZEOnKbk/Txv1BuQc7II/AAAAAAAAEWY/s315MVjm2p4/s640/IMG_0555.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rMcbHLatcU/Txv1VUsT3RI/AAAAAAAAEWg/N7SnfB7NWec/s640/IMG_0562.JPG", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-rtsOOCfpBsk/Txv1XYbUhcI/AAAAAAAAEWo/MBEEoCmC5rs/s640/IMG_0563.JPG", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-v-da3xY65rM/TxwJBqPgovI/AAAAAAAAEWw/Sq-XljpSqO0/s640/IMG_0566.JPG", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-EaWPSAAhWZE/TxwJD5I-XOI/AAAAAAAAEW4/6eWVExgfc14/s640/IMG_0568.JPG"], "page_ulasan_count": null, "page_comment": [], "page_comment_time": [], "page_comment_user": [], "page_comment_user_url": [], "page_comment_user_image_url": []}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640924321", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ikan&updated-max=2012-05-26T23:30:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=840&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/04/kacang-botol-goreng-belacan.html", "list_item_title": "Kacang Botol Goreng Belacan", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "4/02/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n7\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nLauk Pauk\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640924328", "page_title": "Kacang Botol Goreng Belacan", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "4/02/2012", "page_item_category": ["Lauk Pauk", "Sayur"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Lauk%20Pauk?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Sayur?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Banyak pulak stok kacang botol di rumah kerana hubby beli lagi di kedai runcit semalam tanpa menyedari yang saya telah membelinya di Giant. Kalau sekadar dimakan sebagai ulam, nampak gaya akan masuk food disposer jer lah.\u00a0", "Jadi itu yang terus teringat untuk digoreng. Pasti sedap dimakan kerana ianya akan rangup sekali. Krup krup krup bila dikunyah, serius ... tak percaya cuba kunyah...", "Dulu masa rumah di USJ, kami menanam 2 pokok jer kacang botol tapi berbuah buah sampai tak termakan. Saya ni jenis yang akan makan kalau dihidangkan depan mata, kalau mengharapkan saya menghidang sendiri ulam ulaman ni, memang susah lah sikit. Maknanya saya ni kurang menggemari ulamlah tu...\u00a0", "Kacang Botol Goreng Belacan\u00a0", "Oleh: ", "Bahan bahan:", "Kacang botol- potong menyerong", "1/3 cawan minyak masak\u00a0", "Garam secukupnya\u00a0", "Secubit serbuk perasa - opsyenal", "Bahan tumbuk:", "1-2 tangkai cili merah -jika suka pedas tambah cili api", "3 ulas bawang merah", "2 ulas bawang putih", "Segenggam udang kering - boleh guna ikan bilis", "1 sudu besar belacan", "Cara cara:", "Bahan tumbuk ditumbuk kasar kasar. Jangan hancur sangat.", "Panaskan minyak dan tumis bahan tumbuk sehingga\u00a0naik bau dan sedikit garing", "Masukkan kacang botol, garam dan serbuk perasa. Kacau rata dan goreng sekejab sahaja supaya kacang kekal rangup.", "Padamkan api dan sedia untuk dihidangkan panas panas. "], "page_description_image_url": ["https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-GsV5a71lmNg/T3mcnxVu6KI/AAAAAAAAJH0/wDGyja1zHtQ/s640/IMG_9783.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-cXlhePcyinM/T3mcuYvP9WI/AAAAAAAAJIU/WmXXjqpzFfk/s640/IMG_9799.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-GsV5a71lmNg/T3mcnxVu6KI/AAAAAAAAJH0/wDGyja1zHtQ/s640/IMG_9783.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-_HasZTYmubA/T3mciUdy6mI/AAAAAAAAJHU/A6u6YDRymfc/s640/IMG_9761.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-Nje6Y9h6Gsc/T3mcj-MLqDI/AAAAAAAAJHc/kbwaQDPs_0c/s640/IMG_9765.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-pNAllEccVs4/T3mclONbrqI/AAAAAAAAJHk/yjeNXCmBpsc/s640/IMG_9768.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-uYcSdfNC4vw/T3mcmce7F8I/AAAAAAAAJHs/pD7dpiC1E_4/s640/IMG_9770.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Lmb6H_KP9a8/T3mcscX5kzI/AAAAAAAAJIM/yEWauTNplMw/s1600/IMG_9798.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "7 ulasan", "page_comment": ["Nampak best nak try la cantik lak tu", "Nak try right now. Ada kacang botol  banyak i beli dri tesco. Later will comment ok taste cam ne ", "Resepi ni dah ada kt blog hasue thn 2009 dia amik dari blog love..resepi sama", "Saya goreng belacan ni sejak berpuluh tahun dahulu. Biasanya goreng sayur kangkung tp zaman tu tk ada blog. Kalau sama dg resepi orang lain, maknanya saya google mencari idea utk dimasak dan ikut resepi yg dikongsi sebagai jalan mudah utk memasak. Biasanya resepi macam ni sama jer dg masakan mak mak zaman dulu. Jadi tak perlu disebut sebut kr resepi macam ni bukan sesuatu yg unik. ", "Betul tu Kak Azie, x semestinyo kalu resepi tu samo hok demo, bermakna kita copy hok samo..jame tok nenek dlu lg eh duk buat kace botol gore nih..x suka x pyh ikot..bobe bobe jah panda..sy sokmo ikot resepi kak azie kalu nk masok..hihihi..x yoh caro ko hater2 tu azie..", "Setuju sangat. Zaman nenek moyang kita lagi orang dah goreng macam ni. Bukannya ada keunikan pun. Hahaha cuma zaman tak ada blog, ya", "Setuju!!sy pun goreng cara ni..ikut mak nenek dulu2..bkn bermakna kita ikut resepi org..cara kita,kitala.."], "page_comment_time": ["15 Mei, 2013 09:28", "21 Mei, 2013 22:05", "18 Oktober, 2014 08:00", "18 Oktober, 2014 08:55", "30 Mei, 2017 12:32", "30 Mei, 2017 14:36", "02 Julai, 2017 10:50"], "page_comment_user": ["Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/13853811566716092643", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00543883320752487288", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/07404339528136209021"], "page_comment_user_image_url": ["//resources.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif", "//resources.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png", "//3.bp.blogspot.com/-fktyYUEUJY4/UwNXWN1tMRI/AAAAAAAAdZs/fH9jJ1_fa94/s35/*", "//www.blogger.com/img/blogger_logo_round_35.png"]}
{"list_scraping_time": "1640924328", "url_search": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search?q=ikan&updated-max=2012-03-10T19:30:00%2B08:00&max-results=20&start=847&by-date=false", "list_item_url": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/2012/01/bubur-kacang-hijau-dengan-durian-yang.html", "list_item_title": "Bubur Kacang Hijau Dengan Durian Yang Sedap", "list_item_author_name": "Azie", "list_item_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "list_item_post_date": "1/31/2012", "list_item_post_comment_count": "\n20\n                              Comments\n                           \n", "list_item_category": "\nDessert\n", "list_item_category_link": "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Dessert?max-results=6", "page_scraping_time": "1640924330", "page_title": "Bubur Kacang Hijau Dengan Durian Yang Sedap", "page_author_name": "Azie Kitchen", "page_author_url": "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "page_post_date": "1/31/2012", "page_item_category": ["Dessert", "Durian", "Kuih Muih", "Minum Petang"], "page_item_category_link": ["https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Dessert?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Durian?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Kuih%20Muih?max-results=6", "https://www.aziekitchen.com/search/label/Minum%20Petang?max-results=6"], "page_description": ["Dah lama betul saya tak memasak bubur kacang hijau. Since esok cuti sempena hari Wilayah, saya memasak bubur kacang hijau yang kacang nya saya beli di Giant minggu lepas. Kebetulan pula, masih ada durian yang di simpan dalam freezer. Makan pulak dengan roti gardenia, wow sedap gitu.\u00a0", "Kini baru saya tahu, bubur yang cantik, mesti tak mahu pecah minyak. Masa balik Kelantan baru ni, kakak ada sediakan bubur kacang hijau sebagai pencuci mulut untuk majlis kenduri kahwin. Jadi Kak Nik Bidah sepupu yang dok mengacau bubur kacang dalam periuk tu memberi tips memasak bubur kacang hijau tadi.\u00a0", "Selama ini saya fikir bubur perlu dimasak lama lama sampai permukaannya nampak berminyak. Itulah, semakin banyak yang kita belajar, semakin banyak yang kita tak tahu rupanya. Itu sebab kena belajar seumur hidup dan bertanya dengan mereka yang pakar.", "Jom lah, kita layan resepi bubur kacang hijau saya ...", "Bubur Kacang Hijau Dg Durian", "Oleh: ", "Bahan bahan:", "3 cawan kacang hijau", "1 1/2 keping gula melaka", "1 1/2 cawan gula pasir", "2 helai daun pandan", "2 cawan air", "2 cawan santan", "4 - 5 ulas durian", "Garam", "\n", "Cara cara:", "Goreng kacang hijau tanpa minyak dalam ", "4 minit. Kemudian tutup api dan masukkan air untuk direndam dalam 1 jam. Bilas dan rebus sampai empuk.", "\n", "\n", "Didihkan \u00a0air bersama gula pasir, gula melaka dan daun pandan dalam periuk dg api perlahan.\u00a0", "Kacau hingga semua gula larut dan tapiskan", "\n", "\n", "Dalam periuk lain, rebus kacang hijau sehingga kembang dan empuk", "\n", "\n", "Kalau suka, masukkan sagu mata ikan.", "\n", "\n", "Masukkan pula cairan gula tadi dan isi durian. Kacau rata dalam 10 minit dengan api perlahan", "\n", "\n", "Masuk pula santan dan\u00a0kacau lagi hingga sebati dalam 5 minit sahaja supaya tak pecah minyak. rasa kemanisan dan angkat", "\n", "\n", "Hidangkan bersama teh O, tentu sedap sekali. \u00a0Kami cicah dengan roti gardenia", "\n", "\n", "\n", "Enjoy ...", "\n"], "page_description_image_url": ["https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-RuSjMekdojI/TzPlU2f9imI/AAAAAAAAFi4/mZx6r7rJECY/s640/IMG_1652.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-uGs5RkKFSbQ/TzPlSxtHpQI/AAAAAAAAFio/f0yESMOCS6Q/s640/IMG_1642.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-pZ7RGPq6S50/TzPlNEoJmEI/AAAAAAAAFhk/rR62uURbeHQ/s640/IMG_1580.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-CQaMqL8LyOc/TzPlN2NB-JI/AAAAAAAAFho/jMB3lTkGV6U/s640/IMG_1583.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-3OIyBgSHfvU/TzPlOP1n4zI/AAAAAAAAFhw/cS_ovDLQJYQ/s640/IMG_1613.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-E2nnRqvkXyw/TzPlOm7etTI/AAAAAAAAFh4/JlTTOS1mGlQ/s640/IMG_1616.jpg", "https://3.bp.blogspot.com/-rNEah06u-lo/TzPlQxhtivI/AAAAAAAAFiM/g4isv8RvWCI/s640/IMG_1637.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-7qIvCyyqV4s/TzPlPn6TBII/AAAAAAAAFiA/ce_cc8wnn0E/s640/IMG_1629.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-MqAOXq5Z-Zs/TzPlQNcxPTI/AAAAAAAAFiI/VaiFpER0FEw/s640/IMG_1631.jpg", "https://1.bp.blogspot.com/-Acu8TdwUTqM/TzPlRfh0emI/AAAAAAAAFiY/Uh32-bdL10c/s640/IMG_1639.jpg", "https://4.bp.blogspot.com/-8O8s4g50oI0/TzPlR1M7YGI/AAAAAAAAFig/nv6V8lgLPsM/s640/IMG_1640.jpg", "https://2.bp.blogspot.com/-0bjOvp9NMSI/TzPlTe0uNwI/AAAAAAAAFi0/oTyoDC2BKGk/s640/IMG_1649.jpg"], "page_ulasan_count": "20 ulasan", "page_comment": ["kenapa eh ada beberapa bijik kcg hijau yg keras? sbb digoreng tu @ tak cukup lama rebus? fieza", "Assalamualaikum... nak tanye lah.. perempuan mengandung boleh tak makan bubur kacang durian?  Ragu-ragu lah nak makan sebab ade durian..", "Wslm. Tak jadi masalah. Nak makan durian, pun ok. ", "Tumpang tanya, air gula mesti ditapis? Kalu biar saja, mcmana? Penapis xda kot", "Zaza,", "Tak tapis pun ok juga", "Bestnyer.. Sy suka semua jenis bubur.", "Tapi kalau nak lagi sihat boleh tukar gula dengan stevia. Tanpa KALORI, Setitis bersamaan 3 sudu kecil gula.", "nak try boleh wassap saya 0199271048", "Nie resepi utk brape org?", "Sedapnye.. Sedang cuba bt \ud83d\ude0b", "Kalau buat bubur ni tp xletak durian bleh ke?", "Boleh. Durian diletak bagi penggemar durian. Masuk biji sagu pun dah sedap", "Mmg terbaik resepi ni..saya dh cuba dan alhamdulillah family semua suka..bertambah2 mkn.terima kasih azie kitchen..", "resipi ni utk berapa org makan ya", "Air rebusan kacng tu buang ek?", "Tak buang. Terus masuk santan. Air rebusan saya tu kering semasa merebus. ", "garam letak time bila?", "Bila bila masa pun boleh. Tapi seperti biasa bahan perasa spt garam atau gula atau serbuk perasa dimasuk akhir. ", "Kak, gula melaka tu sukatan selain keping, kalau dalam sukaran cawan berapa kak? ", "Masukkan dulu. Dan kemudian boleh rasa. Kalau mahu, masuk juga gula pasir ", "Salam kak resepi ni untuk brapa orang makan ye ", "kenapa bubur saya jadi pekat sangat ya? lepas masak, saya simpan dulu dalam periuk. lepas 2-3 jam dia jadi pekat, kuah semua kering. dia tidak jadi cair cantik begitu"], "page_comment_time": ["06 Oktober, 2013 18:22", "07 Jun, 2014 12:59", "07 Jun, 2014 17:43", "09 Ogos, 2014 11:56", "09 Ogos, 2014 18:41", "08 Mei, 2015 15:17", "11 Julai, 2015 01:55", "31 Januari, 2016 11:21", "15 Februari, 2017 19:19", "15 Februari, 2017 20:29", "16 April, 2017 17:24", "27 Mei, 2017 13:27", "05 Julai, 2017 22:12", "05 Julai, 2017 22:58", "16 Ogos, 2017 23:05", "18 Ogos, 2017 08:09", "30 Oktober, 2018 14:49", "30 Oktober, 2018 15:55", "23 April, 2019 08:19", "16 Mei, 2019 14:21"], "page_comment_user": ["Unknown", "nurul rafieyna", "Azie", "zaza", "Azie", "Ummu Q Healthcare & Beauty", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "lemmy", "Unknown", "Azie", "Unknown", "Azie", "ArtdicteD", "Azie", "lin", "Unknown"], "page_comment_user_url": ["https://www.blogger.com/profile/09476124793510042705", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/17646908193573615393", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/04415671710912280491", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/09442599490293180289", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00945949756654980791", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/03011427964956472276", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/14733850960782864813", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/16841446159103084922", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/07743352884099555555", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/13514312549474713968", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/03641447064205721330", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/02058252209863478318", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/01126195679001058595", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/00119325245731532820", "https://www.blogger.com/profile/0